WEBVTT

00:15:26.960 --> 00:15:30.256
It may be the bravest act
in all the Bible,

00:15:30.280 --> 00:15:33.216
even braver than the act
that holds the whole Book together,

00:15:33.240 --> 00:15:34.440
the crucifixion.

00:15:35.080 --> 00:15:40.176
We are told that up on Calvary,
on an old rugged cross,

00:15:40.200 --> 00:15:42.096
Jesus gave his life to save everybody:

00:15:42.120 --> 00:15:45.040
billions and billions of strangers
for all time to come.

00:15:45.840 --> 00:15:47.696
It's a nice thing to do.

00:15:47.720 --> 00:15:49.456
It made him famous, that's for sure.

00:15:49.480 --> 00:15:51.296
(Laughter)

00:15:51.320 --> 00:15:54.016
But Lot's wife was killed,

00:15:54.040 --> 00:15:56.616
turned into a pillar of salt,

00:15:56.640 --> 00:16:01.416
all because she could not
turn her back on her friends,